  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:350px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-darkblue pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Electromagnetic-Atomic Transmutation</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/5/5a/Jon_Farmer_Earth_50_001.png/revision/latest?cb=20231217133736\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Jon Farmer Earth 50 001\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/5/5a/Jon_Farmer_Earth_50_001.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/515?cb=20231217133736\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/5/5a/Jon_Farmer_Earth_50_001.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/515?cb=20231217133736 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/5/5a/Jon_Farmer_Earth_50_001.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1031?cb=20231217133736 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Jon Farmer Earth 50 001\" width=\"270\" height=\"329\" data-image-key=\"Jon_Farmer_Earth_50_001.png\" data-image-name=\"Jon Farmer Earth 50 001.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">The Transdimensional Man (Wildstorm Comics)</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb electromagnetic energy and convert it to atomic transmutation.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>absorb electromagnetic energy and convert it towards atomic transmutation</b>. Combination of <a href=\"/wiki/Electromagnetic_Conversion\" title=\"Electromagnetic Conversion\">Electromagnetic Conversion</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Transmutation\" title=\"Elemental Transmutation\">Elemental Transmutation</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Conversion\" title=\"Energy Conversion\">Energy Conversion</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FElectromagnetic-Atomic_Transmutation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can absorb electromagnetic energy and convert it towards the transmutation of atoms on various levels.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FElectromagnetic-Atomic_Transmutation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Electromagnetic_Conversion\" title=\"Electromagnetic Conversion\">Electromagnetic Conversion</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Atomic_Transmutation\" title=\"Bio-Atomic Transmutation\">Bio-Atomic Transmutation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Nuclear_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Nuclear Manipulation\">Bio-Nuclear Manipulation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Electromagnetic_Energizing\" title=\"Electromagnetic Energizing\">Electromagnetic Energizing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Electromagnetic_Absorption\" title=\"Electromagnetic Absorption\">Electromagnetic Absorption</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Electromagnetic-Nuclear_Dynamo\" title=\"Electromagnetic-Nuclear Dynamo\">Electromagnetic-Nuclear Dynamo</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Radiative-Nuclear_Dynamo\" title=\"Radiative-Nuclear Dynamo\">Radiative-Nuclear Dynamo</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Transmutation\" title=\"Elemental Transmutation\">Elemental Transmutation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Atomic_Manipulation\" title=\"Atomic Manipulation\">Atomic Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Biological_Transmutation\" title=\"Biological Transmutation\">Biological Transmutation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Organic_Transmutation\" title=\"Organic Transmutation\">Organic</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Inorganic_Transmutation\" title=\"Inorganic Transmutation\">Inorganic Transmutation</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Electromagnetism_Manipulation\" title=\"Personal Electromagnetism Manipulation\">Personal Electromagnetism Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Atomic_Manipulation\" title=\"Self-Atomic Manipulation\">Self-Atomic Manipulation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Radiative-Atomic_Transmutation\" title=\"Radiative-Atomic Transmutation\">Radiative-Atomic Transmutation</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FElectromagnetic-Atomic_Transmutation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Alien_Physiology\" title=\"Alien Physiology\">Alien Physiology</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Conversion\" title=\"Energy Conversion\">Energy Conversion</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ambient_Energy_Conversion\" title=\"Ambient Energy Conversion\">Ambient Energy Conversion</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Electromagnetism_Generation\" title=\"Electromagnetism Generation\">Electromagnetism Generation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FElectromagnetic-Atomic_Transmutation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Power may be limited to how much energy user has/can absorb.</li>\n<li>Opposing <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Energy Absorption\">Energy Absorption</a> powers can weaken user.</li>\n<li>The user may be at a disadvantage in areas with a lack of energy to absorb.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FElectromagnetic-Atomic_Transmutation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://dc.fandom.com/wiki/Nathaniel_Adam_(New_Earth)#Powers_and_Abilities\">Nathaniel Adam/Captain Atom</a> (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://dc.fandom.com/wiki/Richard_Redditch_(New_Earth)\">Richard Redditch/The Artist</a> (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://marvel.fandom.com/wiki/Genis-Vell_(Earth-616)\">Genis-Vell/Photon</a> (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://dc.fandom.com/wiki/Jon_Farmer_(Wildstorm_Universe)\">Jon Farmer/The Transdimensional Man</a> (<i>Wildstorm Comics</i>)</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260805101238\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.019 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.059 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 110/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 89/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 83/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    8.259      1 Template:Infobox\n100.00%    8.259      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_powerlisting:pcache:idhash:515799-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260805101238 and revision id 2387422. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>",
